-- ====================================================================
-- AVEVA E3D Nozzle Specification Manager -- launcher
-- Form Name: !!nozzleSpecConverter
-- Usage in E3D Command Line:
--   $M "<install dir>\launch_nozzle_tool.mac"
-- ====================================================================
--
-- Reconstructed 2026-08-18. The original launcher was referenced by
-- add_to_e3d_menu.mac and by the plugin README, but was never copied into the
-- repository and no longer exists on the machine that built it, so the plugin
-- as committed had no working entry point. This file restores it from the
-- form definition in nozzleSpecConverter.pmlfrm.
--
-- It follows the same convention as add_to_e3d_menu.mac: kill any previous
-- instance inside a handler (so a first run, when nothing is loaded yet, does
-- not raise), reload the form definition, then show it.
--
-- The $M path below must match wherever this plugin is installed. E3D resolves
-- macro paths at call time, not relative to this file.

$S-  -- Synonym translation OFF

-- Drop any previously loaded copy so an edited form is picked up on reload.
handle ANY
  kill !!nozzleSpecConverter
endhandle

-- Load the form definition. Adjust this path to the install location.
$M "C:\Users\A\Desktop\nozzleSpecConverter.pmlfrm"

handle ANY
  $P Could not load nozzleSpecConverter.pmlfrm -- check the path above.
  return
endhandle

show !!nozzleSpecConverter

$S+  -- Synonym translation ON
